DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nBoosting Mental Health Outcomes for ME\, WE and E\nSp
	eaker\n:\nAlistair Carmichael \nSynopsis\n:\nYou will hear the latest from
	 the McKinsey Health Institute and their global experience\, with key take
	aways to improve your mental health and wellbeing. We will discuss what dr
	ives positive and negative mental health outcomes and dig into what we can
	 do together to strengthen mental health and wellbeing in our teams and pr
	actical things we can do for ourselves.\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)
	\n \nJoin via Laptop\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\, you 
	must follow this  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4 <https://dbs1b
	ank-my.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJ
	ZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2>  guide prior to the event. This wil
	l install Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming
	 experience!\n1.	On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex 
	Events URL <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=ebba34ae8cf4954e9
	9a3843031f5d5b75> \n2.	Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address a
	nd click on [Join Now]\n \n \nJoin via Mobile Device\n1.	Download Webex Me
	etings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting
	 & Input Meeting Number: 2515 914 8254\n2.	Input Password 1234\n \n \nJoin
	 via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-301
	8-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-
	6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2515 914 8254\nGlobal call-i
	n numbers <https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e1be1d7fb8cf19d
	adf242f64798d49372> \n \n \n
DTEND;TZID="Singapore Standard Time":20230721T135000
